msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Project-Id-Version: BestMinimap\n"
"Language: zh_CN\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"

msgid "1-10 (10% steps). Only the map: the markers stay opaque."
msgstr "1-10（每级 10%）。只影响地图：标记始终不透明。"

msgid "A bigger map picture is scaled down in memory to this size."
msgstr "更大的地图图片会在内存中缩小到此尺寸。"

msgid "A minimap in the corner of the screen: the game's map picture, characters nearby, Map-markers and WantedMap markers."
msgstr "屏幕角落的小地图：游戏的地图图片、附近的角色、Map-markers 和 WantedMap 的标记。"

msgid "A small arrow in the centre."
msgstr "中心的小箭头。"

msgid "Allies"
msgstr "盟友"

msgid "Animals"
msgstr "动物"

msgid "Background"
msgstr "背景"

msgid "Bigger key"
msgstr "放大小地图按键"

msgid "Camera direction"
msgstr "镜头方向"

msgid "Centre on the selected"
msgstr "以选中角色为中心"

msgid "Circle"
msgstr "圆形"

msgid "Colour where the map picture ends."
msgstr "地图图片之外区域的颜色。"

msgid "Colours"
msgstr "颜色"

msgid "Detailed log"
msgstr "详细日志"

msgid "Diagnostics"
msgstr "诊断"

msgid "Diameter of the circle, side of the square, width of the rectangle. CTRL+wheel over the minimap changes it too."
msgstr "圆形的直径、正方形的边长、矩形的宽度。在小地图上按住 CTRL 滚动滚轮也可调整。"

msgid "Dimmed."
msgstr "暗淡显示。"

msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "启用"

msgid "Enemies"
msgstr "敌人"

msgid "Frame"
msgstr "边框"

msgid "Frame colour"
msgstr "边框颜色"

msgid "From the centre to the edge. The wheel over the minimap and the zoom keys change it too. The map picture of the game has about 70 m in a pixel, so below about 1500 m it gets blurry."
msgstr "从中心到边缘的距离。在小地图上滚动滚轮或使用缩放按键也可调整。游戏地图图片每像素约 70 米，因此低于约 1500 米时会变模糊。"

msgid "Game panel"
msgstr "游戏面板"

msgid "Game panel - the skin of the game's own panels (and of interface mods); the circle gets a line in the colour of the game palette."
msgstr "游戏面板 - 使用游戏自带面板（及界面模组）的外观；圆形则使用游戏配色的线条。"

msgid "General"
msgstr "常规"

msgid "If the colours of the minimap look wrong (blue sand)."
msgstr "如果小地图颜色不对（沙子变成蓝色）。"

msgid "In RE_Kenshi_log.txt."
msgstr "写入 RE_Kenshi_log.txt。"

msgid "Line"
msgstr "线条"

msgid "Lock position"
msgstr "锁定位置"

msgid "Look"
msgstr "外观"

msgid "Lower - less work for the processor."
msgstr "越低，处理器负担越小。"

msgid "Makes the minimap itself bigger on the screen."
msgstr "让小地图本身在屏幕上变大。"

msgid "Map"
msgstr "地图"

msgid "Map picture limit, px"
msgstr "地图图片上限（像素）"

msgid "Map-markers markers"
msgstr "Map-markers 标记"

msgid "Marker size, px"
msgstr "标记大小（像素）"

msgid "Markers of Map-markers and WantedMap that are out of range stay at the edge, pointing the way."
msgstr "超出范围的 Map-markers 和 WantedMap 标记停留在边缘，指示方向。"

msgid "Markers of the Map-markers mod, from the current save."
msgstr "来自当前存档的 Map-markers 模组标记。"

msgid "Neutrals"
msgstr "中立"

msgid "None"
msgstr "无"

msgid "Off - drag the minimap with the left mouse button."
msgstr "关闭时可用鼠标左键拖动小地图。"

msgid "Off - no minimap at all."
msgstr "关闭时完全不显示小地图。"

msgid "Off - north is always up."
msgstr "关闭时北方始终朝上。"

msgid "Off - on the centre of the camera."
msgstr "关闭时以镜头中心为中心。"

msgid "Opacity"
msgstr "不透明度"

msgid "Pin to the edge"
msgstr "固定在边缘"

msgid "Range, m"
msgstr "范围（米）"

msgid "Rectangle"
msgstr "矩形"

msgid "Rotate with the camera"
msgstr "随镜头旋转"

msgid "Shape"
msgstr "形状"

msgid "Show / hide key"
msgstr "显示 / 隐藏按键"

msgid "Shown"
msgstr "已显示"

msgid "Shows or hides the minimap."
msgstr "显示或隐藏小地图。"

msgid "Size, px"
msgstr "大小（像素）"

msgid "Smaller key"
msgstr "缩小小地图按键"

msgid "Square"
msgstr "正方形"

msgid "Swap red and blue"
msgstr "交换红色和蓝色"

msgid "Targets of the WantedMap mod, as of the last look at the big map."
msgstr "WantedMap 模组的目标，以最后一次查看大地图时为准。"

msgid "The dead"
msgstr "死者"

msgid "The same switch as the show / hide key."
msgstr "与显示 / 隐藏按键相同的开关。"

msgid "Updates per second"
msgstr "每秒刷新次数"

msgid "WantedMap targets"
msgstr "WantedMap 目标"

msgid "Who is shown"
msgstr "显示对象"

msgid "Your squad"
msgstr "你的小队"

msgid "Zoom in key"
msgstr "拉近按键"

msgid "Zoom out key"
msgstr "拉远按键"

msgid "auto - from the palette of the game (and of interface mods)."
msgstr "auto - 使用游戏（及界面模组）的配色。"

msgid "auto - the colour the game gives this character on the big map."
msgstr "auto - 使用游戏在大地图上标记该角色的颜色。"

msgid "Your squad colour"
msgstr "你的小队颜色"

msgid "Allies colour"
msgstr "盟友颜色"

msgid "Neutrals colour"
msgstr "中立颜色"

msgid "Enemies colour"
msgstr "敌人颜色"

msgid "Animals colour"
msgstr "动物颜色"

msgid "The rectangle is 16:10, its width is the Size."
msgstr "矩形为 16:10，宽度即“大小”。"

msgid "Attack alert"
msgstr "遇袭警报"

msgid "Alert when your people are attacked"
msgstr "己方遇袭时警报"

msgid "A pulsing ring on the minimap where a character of your faction is attacked; out of range - at the edge, pointing the way."
msgstr "己方角色遇袭时，小地图上该位置出现脉动圆环；超出范围时显示在边缘并指示方向。"

msgid "Alert colour"
msgstr "警报颜色"

msgid "Alert lasts, s"
msgstr "警报持续（秒）"

msgid "How long the ring stays after the last attack."
msgstr "最后一次攻击后圆环保留的时间。"

msgid "Message in the game"
msgstr "游戏内消息"

msgid "Under attack: and the names - in the game's message line, at most once in 3 seconds."
msgstr "在游戏消息栏显示“遭受攻击：”及名字，最多每 3 秒一次。"

msgid "Flash the frame"
msgstr "边框闪烁"

msgid "While someone is attacked the frame of the minimap blinks in the alert colour."
msgstr "有人遇袭时，小地图边框以警报颜色闪烁。"

msgid "Camera range"
msgstr "镜头范围"

msgid "Show how far the camera can go"
msgstr "显示镜头可移动的范围"

msgid "A thin line around your characters: the camera cannot be moved farther."
msgstr "你的角色周围的细线：镜头无法移出此范围。"

msgid "Camera range, m"
msgstr "镜头范围（米）"

msgid "0 - found out by itself: move the camera away from your people as far as it goes once, and the line takes that distance."
msgstr "0 - 自动获取：将镜头从你的角色处移到最远一次，线条就会采用该距离。"

msgid "Camera line colour"
msgstr "镜头线颜色"

msgid "Under attack: "
msgstr "遭受攻击："

msgid "A gold ring and the sum on characters with a price on their head."
msgstr "悬赏角色显示金色圆环和金额。"

msgid "A name under every dot. Many dots - many names."
msgstr "每个点下显示名字。点多则名字多。"

msgid "A small nose on each dot: where the character looks."
msgstr "每个点上的小尖角：角色面朝的方向。"

msgid "A thin white circle: how far the town reaches."
msgstr "细白圈：城镇的范围。"

msgid "All squads"
msgstr "所有小队"

msgid "Bounties"
msgstr "悬赏"

msgid "Bounty colour"
msgstr "悬赏颜色"

msgid "Camera line style"
msgstr "镜头线样式"

msgid "Character names"
msgstr "角色名字"

msgid "Dotted"
msgstr "虚线"

msgid "Everything the big map marks: towns, outposts, camps, nests, ruins - as the game knows them."
msgstr "大地图上标记的一切：城镇、前哨、营地、巢穴、遗迹 - 按游戏所知显示。"

msgid "Facing"
msgstr "朝向"

msgid "Flip the facing"
msgstr "反转朝向"

msgid "Hover a town or a character on the minimap: name, faction and relations, squad, bounty."
msgstr "将鼠标悬停在小地图上的城镇或角色上：名字、派系与关系、小队、悬赏。"

msgid "If the noses point backwards."
msgstr "如果尖角朝向反了。"

msgid "Names up to range, m"
msgstr "名称显示的最大范围（米）"

msgid "Other squads"
msgstr "其他小队"

msgid "Right click - go there"
msgstr "右键 - 前往该处"

msgid "Right click on the minimap sends the selected characters to that spot, as a right click on the ground does."
msgstr "在小地图上右键，选中的角色会前往该位置，与右键点击地面相同。"

msgid "Solid"
msgstr "实线"

msgid "Squad name colour"
msgstr "小队名称颜色"

msgid "Squad names"
msgstr "小队名称"

msgid "The name of a squad over its leader."
msgstr "小队名称显示在队长上方。"

msgid "Tooltips"
msgstr "提示"

msgid "Town colour"
msgstr "城镇颜色"

msgid "Town names"
msgstr "城镇名称"

msgid "Town names are shown while the range is not wider than this: on the whole map they would merge."
msgstr "范围不超过此值时显示城镇名称：在整张地图上它们会挤成一团。"

msgid "Town radius"
msgstr "城镇范围"

msgid "Towns"
msgstr "城镇"

msgid "Towns and places"
msgstr "城镇与地点"

msgid "ally"
msgstr "盟友"

msgid "auto - by the relations of the town's faction to yours: red hostile, green ally."
msgstr "auto - 按城镇派系与你的关系着色：红色敌对，绿色盟友。"

msgid "hostile"
msgstr "敌对"

msgid "neutral"
msgstr "中立"

msgid "your faction"
msgstr "你的派系"

msgid "Town icons"
msgstr "城镇图标"

msgid "As on the game map"
msgstr "与游戏地图相同"

msgid "Diamonds"
msgstr "菱形"

msgid "As on the game map - the icons of the big map, from the game's interface and interface mods. Places the big map has no icon for get a diamond."
msgstr "与游戏地图相同 - 使用大地图的图标, 来自游戏界面和界面模组。大地图没有图标的地点显示为菱形。"

msgid "Town icon size, px"
msgstr "城镇图标大小, 像素"

msgid "Town name size, px"
msgstr "城镇名称大小, 像素"

msgid "0 - like the other labels."
msgstr "0 - 与其他标签相同。"

msgid "Danger"
msgstr "危险"

msgid "Stash"
msgstr "藏匿处"

msgid "Ruin"
msgstr "废墟"

msgid "Mine / Resource"
msgstr "矿场 / 资源"

msgid "Base / Outpost"
msgstr "基地 / 前哨"

msgid "Trader / Shop"
msgstr "商人 / 商店"

msgid "Safe Spot / Bed / Recovery"
msgstr "安全点 / 床 / 恢复"

msgid "Quest"
msgstr "任务"

msgid "Todo"
msgstr "待办"

msgid "Note"
msgstr "笔记"
